COMPILATION OF: E48B8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48B8

   1 a 0000 E48B8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1 r2] `name = 'AB'' THEN `b = (name = 'AB')': one
   4 a 0006      literal used by a varying store AND by the comparison.  If
   5 a 0006      DR dedups it to ONE cell the pool is 2 bytes, not 4, and the
   6 a 0006      SCVCM's MVI A operand names the same cell the store wrote. */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl name char(30) varying;
   9 c 0006   name = 'AB';
  10 c 0013   b = (name = 'AB');
  11 c 0024   put list('R=', b);
  12 c 0046   stop;
  13 a 0049 end E48B8;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 0024
FREE SYMS = 389E
END  COMPILATION
